{"type":"message","id":"0e170980","parentId":"4a686834","timestamp":"2026-03-14T04:59:59.269Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 12:59 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为干活小弟，请完成以下任务：\n\n## 任务1：记录错误到 ERRORS.md\n\n在 `/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/ERRORS.md` 文件开头添加以下错误记录：\n\n```markdown\n## [ERR-20250314-004] 混淆了搜索工具类型，错误使用 kimi_search.js 代替 web_fetch\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:58:00Z\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: resolved\n**Area**: search\n\n### Summary\n用户要求\"试一下调用网络搜索工具\"搜索 \"Open spec\"，但我错误地使用了 `kimi_search.js`（本地 Kimi API 调用），而不是使用 `multi-search-engine` 的 `web_fetch` 直接访问搜索引擎。混淆了\"本地 API 调用\"和\"真正的网络搜索\"。\n\n### Error\n**用户指令**: \"试一下调用网络搜索工具\"\n**我的错误操作**: 使用了 `kimi_search.js` 调用本地 Kimi API\n**正确操作**: 应该使用 `multi-search-engine` + `web_fetch` 直接访问搜索引擎 URL\n\n### Context\n- `kimi_search.js` = 本地 Kimi API 调用（不是真正的网络搜索）\n- `multi-search-engine` + `web_fetch` = 真正的网络搜索（直接访问 Google, Bing 等）\n- 用户明确说\"网络搜索工具\"，意味着要使用真正的网络搜索\n\n### Suggested Fix\n1. **明确区分搜索方式**：\n   - 本地 API 调用：`kimi_search.js`（Kimi API）\n   - 网络搜索：`multi-search-engine` + `web_fetch`（直接访问搜索引擎）\n\n2. **当用户说\"网络搜索\"时**：\n   - 优先使用 `multi-search-engine` + `web_fetch`\n   - 直接使用搜索引擎 URL（Google, Bing, DuckDuckGo 等）\n\n3. **记录并学习**：\n   - 记录这次错误（本记录）\n   - 在 EVOLUTION.md 中明确搜索工具的选择规则\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: ~/kimi_search.js, ~/skills/multi-search-engine/SKILL.md\n- See Also: LRN-20250314-001（搜索工具学习）, ERR-20250314-003（web_search 失败）\n\n---\n```\n\n## 任务2：使用正确的网络搜索工具搜索 \"Open spec\"\n\n使用 `multi-search-engine` + `web_fetch` 直接访问搜索引擎：\n\n**测试以下搜索引擎**（选择几个可用的）：\n1. Bing CN: `https://cn.bing.com/search?q=Open+spec+开放规范`\n2. Google HK: `https://www.google.com.hk/search?q=Open+spec`\n3. 百度: `https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=Open+spec`\n\n使用 `web_fetch` 工具访问上述 URL，测试哪些可用，然后返回搜索结果摘要。\n\n**输出格式**：\n```\n## 网络搜索结果\n\n### 测试的搜索引擎\n| 引擎 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Bing CN | ✅/❌ | ... |\n| Google HK | ✅/❌ | ... |\n| 百度 | ✅/❌ | ... |\n\n### 搜索结果摘要\n[从可用的搜索引擎中提取的 Open spec 相关信息摘要]\n```\n\n请完成这两个任务，并返回完整的结果。"}],"timestamp":1773464399268}}
{"type":"message","id":"26e1cbc9","parentId":"0e170980","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:00:02.833Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/ERRORS.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/multi-search-engine/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773464399269}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd7ee528","parentId":"26e1cbc9","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:00:02.839Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 错误记录\n\n## [ERR-20250314-003] web_search 工具 Brave API 认证失败\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:47:00Z\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: resolved\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n内置的 `web_search` 工具因 Brave API 认证失败无法使用，但找到了备用方案 `multi-search-engine` skill。\n\n### Error\n```\nKimi API error (401): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Invalid Authentication\",\"type\":\"invalid_authentication_error\"}}\n```\n\n### Context\n- 尝试使用 `web_search` 搜索 \"Open spec\"\n- 之前多次重试均失败\n- 发现备用搜索 skill `multi-search-engine`，有 17 个搜索引擎，无需 API key\n\n### 解决方案\n使用 `multi-search-engine` skill 作为备用搜索工具，通过 `web_fetch` 直接访问搜索引擎 URL。\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: ~/skills/multi-search-engine/SKILL.md\n- See Also: LRN-20250314-001（搜索工具学习）\n\n---\n\n## [ERR-20250314-002] web_search 工具失败\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:18:00Z\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: resolved\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n内置的 `web_search` 工具因 API 认证失败无法使用。\n\n### Error\n```\nKimi API error (401): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Invalid Authentication\",\"type\":\"invalid_authentication_error\"}}\n```\n\n### Context\n- 尝试使用 `web_search` 搜索 \"Open spec skill agent framework specification\"\n- API 返回 401 认证错误\n- 多次重试均失败\n\n### Suggested Fix\n- 使用备用搜索工具 `kimi_search.js`\n- 或直接使用 `web_fetch` 访问搜索引擎\n- 已更新 MEMORY.md 记录此问题\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: ~/MEMORY.md\n- See Also: LRN-20250314-001\n\n---\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773464402836}}
{"type":"message","id":"ae9a24ef","parentId":"cd7ee528","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:00:02.845Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: \"multi-search-engine\"\ndescription: \"Multi search engine integration with 17 engines (8 CN + 9 Global). Supports advanced search operators, time filters, site search, privacy engines, and WolframAlpha knowledge queries. No API keys required.\"\n---\n\n# Multi Search Engine v2.0.1\n\nIntegration of 17 search engines for web crawling without API keys.\n\n## Search Engines\n\n### Domestic (8)\n- **Baidu**: `https://www.baidu.com/s?wd={keyword}`\n- **Bing CN**: `https://cn.bing.com/search?q={keyword}&ensearch=0`\n- **Bing INT**: `https://cn.bing.com/search?q={keyword}&ensearch=1`\n- **360**: `https://www.so.com/s?q={keyword}`\n- **Sogou**: `https://sogou.com/web?query={keyword}`\n- **WeChat**: `https://wx.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&query={keyword}`\n- **Toutiao**: `https://so.toutiao.com/search?keyword={keyword}`\n- **Jisilu**: `https://www.jisilu.cn/explore/?keyword={keyword}`\n\n### International (9)\n- **Google**: `https://www.google.com/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Google HK**: `https://www.google.com.hk/search?q={keyword}`\n- **DuckDuckGo**: `https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q={keyword}`\n- **Yahoo**: `https://search.yahoo.com/search?p={keyword}`\n- **Startpage**: `https://www.startpage.com/sp/search?query={keyword}`\n- **Brave**: `https://search.brave.com/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Ecosia**: `https://www.ecosia.org/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Qwant**: `https://www.qwant.com/?q={keyword}`\n- **WolframAlpha**: `https://www.wolframalpha.com/input?i={keyword}`\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n```javascript\n// Basic search\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=python+tutorial\"})\n\n// Site-specific\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=site:github.com+react\"})\n\n// File type\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=machine+learning+filetype:pdf\"})\n\n// Time filter (past week)\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=ai+news&tbs=qdr:w\"})\n\n// Privacy search\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=privacy+tools\"})\n\n// DuckDuckGo Bangs\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=!gh+tensorflow\"})\n\n// Knowledge calculation\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.wolframalpha.com/input?i=100+USD+to+CNY\"})\n```\n\n## Advanced Operators\n\n| Operator | Example | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `site:` | `site:github.com python` | Search within site |\n| `filetype:` | `filetype:pdf report` | Specific file type |\n| `\"\"` | `\"machine learning\"` | Exact match |\n| `-` | `python -snake` | Exclude term |\n| `OR` | `cat OR dog` | Either term |\n\n## Time Filters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `tbs=qdr:h` | Past hour |\n| `tbs=qdr:d` | Past day |\n| `tbs=qdr:w` | Past week |\n| `tbs=qdr:m` | Past month |\n| `tbs=qdr:y` | Past year |\n\n## Privacy Engines\n\n- **DuckDuckGo**: No tracking\n- **Startpage**: Google results + privacy\n- **Brave**: Independent index\n- **Qwant**: EU GDPR compliant\n\n## Bangs Shortcuts (DuckDuckGo)\n\n| Bang | Destination |\n|------|-------------|\n| `!g` | Google |\n| `!gh` | GitHub |\n| `!so` | Stack Overflow |\n| `!w` | Wikipedia |\n| `!yt` | YouTube |\n\n## WolframAlpha Queries\n\n- Math: `integrate x^2 dx`\n- Conversion: `100 USD to CNY`\n- Stocks: `AAPL stock`\n- Weather: `weather in Beijing`\n\n## Documentation\n\n- `references/advanced-search.md` - Domestic search guide\n- `references/international-search.md` - International search guide\n- `CHANGELOG.md` - Version history\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773464402842}}
