gine` skill 作为备用搜索工具，通过 `web_fetch` 直接访问搜索引擎 URL。\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: ~/skills/multi-search-engine/SKILL.md\n- See Also: LRN-20250314-001（搜索工具学习）\n\n---\n\n## [ERR-20250314-002] web_search 工具失败\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:18:00Z\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: resolved\n**Area**: config\n\n### Summary\n内置的 `web_search` 工具因 API 认证失败无法使用。\n\n### Error\n```\nKimi API error (401): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Invalid Authentication\",\"type\":\"invalid_authentication_error\"}}\n```\n\n### Context\n- 尝试使用 `web_search` 搜索 \"Open spec skill agent framework specification\"\n- API 返回 401 认证错误\n- 多次重试均失败\n\n### Suggested Fix\n- 使用备用搜索工具 `kimi_search.js`\n- 或直接使用 `web_fetch` 访问搜索引擎\n- 已更新 MEMORY.md 记录此问题\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: ~/MEMORY.md\n- See Also: LRN-20250314-001\n\n---\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773464402845}}
